Demand for Documentation Please provide the following within 30 days of receipt of this letter : Verified chain of assignment with all supporting documents ; Copy of the original agreement or application bearing my signature ; Full account statement history, including charges and payments ; Copies of any assignment notifications issued to me ; Any documentation relied upon in furnishing this data to credit bureaus.

