13340700,2025-05-05,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XX/XX/XXXX To : Credit Reporting Agency Subject : Request for Removal of Unverifiable Account Dear Credit Reporting Department, I am writing to formally request the removal of an account from my credit report as reported by [ Equifax, Experian, or TransUnion ]. This request is based on the recent deletion of an account by XXXX, XXXX of the XXXX major credit reporting agencies. I recently disputed a charge-off for { XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX, XXXX XXXX XXXX and XXXX XXXX  XXXX, listed on my XXXX report, and following a thorough investigation, XXXX has completely removed this unverifiable debt from my report as of { XX/XX/XXXX account was deleted from XXXX }. 
