This is a clear violation of FCRA 15 U.S. Code 1681s-2 ( b ), which mandates that data furnishers report complete and accurate information. It is not only inaccurate but also deceptive to report a charge-off nearly two years after the 180-day delinquency threshold was already met in XXXX. 

