The repeated failure to remove this fraudulent account and incorrect addresses shows a systemic breakdown in compliance and poses an ongoing threat to my financial security and personal wellbeing. The consumer reporting agencies ' reliance on templated replies and failure to act in good faith with regard to my prior disputes further compounds the harm I have suffered. 

What would you like the company to do to resolve your issue? 
